flowchart TD
    subgraph Mobile Clients
        C1[Client 1]
        C2[Client 2]
        C3[Client N]
    end

    LB[Load Balancer]

    subgraph Real-Time Tier
        WS1[WebSocket Server 1]
        WS2[WebSocket Server 2]
        WS3[WebSocket Server N]
    end

    subgraph Internal Routing & State
        RedisCache[(Redis Location Cache\nTTL: 10m)]
        RedisPubSub((Redis Pub/Sub Cluster\n14M ops/sec))
        FriendGraph[(Friend Graph Service)]
    end

    subgraph Async Persistence
        KafkaQueue[[Kafka Topic\nlocation_events]]
        Workers[Storage Workers]
        Cassandra[(Cassandra\nLocation History)]
    end

    C1 <-->|WebSocket| LB
    C2 <-->|WebSocket| LB
    C3 <-->|WebSocket| LB

    LB <--> WS1
    LB <--> WS2
    LB <--> WS3

    %% Real-time flow
    WS1 -.->|1. Fetch Friends| FriendGraph
    WS1 -.->|2. Initial State Query| RedisCache
    WS1 -->|3. Publish Update| RedisPubSub
    WS1 -->|4. Update Cache| RedisCache

    RedisPubSub -->|5. Fan-out| WS2
    RedisPubSub -->|5. Fan-out| WS3

    %% Async flow
    WS1 -->|Async Copy| KafkaQueue
    WS2 -->|Async Copy| KafkaQueue
    WS3 -->|Async Copy| KafkaQueue

    KafkaQueue --> Workers
    Workers -->|Batch Write| Cassandra

